# OPENAI_SCAM_MODEL and OPENAI_TELEGRAM_MODEL are gone. Both named a per-feature model
# default that no code reads any more: scam_shield and telegram_text_router route through
# undx_router, whose PROVIDERS table is the single answer to "which model". A documented
# variable that nothing reads is worse than an undocumented one, because an operator can
